<template><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="page-width inner-page"><PageHeading number="04" english="A LITTLE HISTORY CHALLENGE" title="拾起记忆，续写回响。">读过的故事，见过的风景，<br>是否已经成为你的山大记忆？</PageHeading><section v-if="!started" class="quiz-intro enter"><div class="quiz-intro-copy"><span class="eyebrow">THE FIRST CHAPTER</span><h2>你与山大，<br>有多少共同记忆？</h2><p>五道小题，循着校史的足迹，<br>收藏一枚属于你的「山大记忆」印章。</p><div class="quiz-meta"><span><Icon name="book"/> 5 道精选题目</span><span><Icon name="clock"/> 约 2 分钟</span></div><button class="button primary" @click="restart">翻开第一题 <Icon name="arrow"/></button><span class="quiz-best">{{ best ? `这台设备的最高成绩：${best} 分` : '从好奇开始，无需准备。' }}</span></div><div class="quiz-book-art"><div class="book-shadow"></div><div class="book-cover"><span class="book-border"></span><span class="book-small">山东大学 · 校史札记</span><strong>山大<br>记忆</strong><span class="book-line"></span><small>一卷百年<br>待君拾趣</small><span class="book-year">SINCE 1901</span><span class="book-seal">求知</span></div><span class="book-caption">学无止境，探索亦然。</span></div></section>
<template v-else-if="finished"><section class="quiz-result"><div class="result-seal">山大<br>记忆</div><span class="eyebrow">A NEW MEMORY COLLECTED</span><h2>{{ score >= 80 ? '你已读懂，这一页山大。' : '每一次探索，都在走近山大。' }}</h2><div class="result-score">{{ score }}<small>/ 100</small></div><p>答对 {{ score / 20 }} / 5 题</p><div class="result-actions"><button class="button primary" @click="restart">再温习一次 <Icon name="reset"/></button><RouterLink class="button outline" to="/gallery">去展廊继续发现 <Icon name="arrow"/></RouterLink></div></section><section class="quiz-review"><div class="section-label"><span>把这份记忆再读一遍</span><small>REVIEW YOUR JOURNEY</small></div><details v-for="(q, i) in questions" :key="q.question"><summary><span class="review-status" :class="answers[i] === q.correct ? 'correct' : 'incorrect'"><Icon :name="answers[i] === q.correct ? 'check' : 'close'"/></span>{{ q.question }}<Icon name="chevron"/></summary><p>你的选择：{{ q.choices[answers[i]] }}<br>正确答案：{{ q.choices[q.correct] }}<br>{{ q.explanation }}<small>资料依据：{{ q.source }}</small></p></details></section></template>
<div v-else class="quiz-workspace"><aside class="quiz-sidebar"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR JOURNEY</span><h2>沿着记忆，<br>慢慢作答。</h2><ol><li v-for="(q, i) in questions" :key="q.question" :class="{current: index === i, complete: answers.length > i}"><span>{{ i + 1 }}</span>{{ q.tag }}</li></ol><p>不急着知道所有答案，<br>每一次好奇，都有回响。</p></aside><section class="question-sheet"><div class="question-meta"><span>QUESTION {{ index + 1 }}</span><span>{{ index + 1 }} / 5</span></div><div class="question-progress"><i :style="{width: (index + 1) * 20 + '%'}"></i></div><span class="question-tag">{{ current.tag }} · 单项选择</span><h2>{{ current.question }}</h2><div class="answer-options"><button v-for="(choice, i) in current.choices" :key="choice" class="answer-option" :class="{selected: selected === i, right: answered && current.correct === i, wrong: answered && selected === i && current.correct !== i}" :aria-pressed="selected === i" :disabled="answered" @click="selected = i"><span class="answer-letter">{{ 'ABCD'[i] }}</span><span>{{ choice }}</span></button></div><div v-if="answered" class="answer-explanation" role="status"><strong>{{ selected === current.correct ? '回答正确，这一页记忆属于你了。' : '答案藏在这里，再多认识一点山大。' }}</strong><p>{{ current.explanation }}</p><small>资料依据：{{ current.source }}</small></div><div class="question-footer"><span>学无止境 · 每一题都是一次发现</span><button class="button primary" :disabled="selected === null" @click="advance">{{ answered ? index === 4 ? '查看我的成绩' : '继续下一题' : '确认答案' }} <Icon name="arrow"/></button></div></section></div></main></template>
<script setup>
import { ref, computed } from 'vue'
import { questions } from '@/data/exhibit'
import { readStorage, writeStorage } from '@/utils/storage'
import PageHeading from '@/components/PageHeading.vue'
import Icon from '@/components/ExhibitIcon.vue'
const started = ref(false), finished = ref(false), index = ref(0), selected = ref(null), answers = ref([]), best = ref(Number(readStorage('sdu-design-quiz-best', 0)) || 0)
const current = computed(() => questions[index.value]), answered = computed(() => answers.value.length > index.value), score = computed(() => answers.value.reduce((sum, a, i) => sum + (a === questions[i].correct ? 20 : 0), 0))
function restart() { started.value = true; finished.value = false; index.value = 0; selected.value = null; answers.value = [] }
function advance() { if (selected.value === null) return; if (!answered.value) { answers.value.push(selected.value); return } if (index.value === questions.length - 1) { finished.value = true; best.value = Math.max(best.value, score.value); writeStorage('sdu-design-quiz-best', best.value) } else { index.value++; selected.value = null } }
</script>
